The `cas_retry` method provides retry orchestration (exponential backoff +
jitter), but each call site builds its own set of `Compare`s, `TxnOp`s, and
handles the `succeeded()` check manually. Extracting a higher-level
abstraction would reduce boilerplate and make transaction construction
less error-prone.

