}
```

The generic contract for this method is already defined in `crates/gossip-coordination/src/traits.rs:426-456`, and the concrete error surface is already stable in `crates/gossip-coordination/src/error.rs:964-1065`.

The crate also still describes the async core as though it is broadly equivalent to the sync wrapper:

