## Desired State

`AsyncEtcdCoordinator::park_shard` should persist the same terminal shard transition as the sync wrapper:

- compute `hash_park_payload(reason)` and honor replay before lease/terminal rejection
- validate the presented lease/fence using the shared lease-validation helper
- transition the shard record to `ShardStatus::Parked`, record `park_reason`, clear the lease, and append the op-log entry
- atomically delete the owner key and active-shard index marker in the same CAS transaction that writes the parked shard record
- best-effort revoke the etcd owner lease after a committed transaction
- refresh cached run state exactly as the sync surface does
- update docs/debug metadata so the async coordinator no longer advertises an outdated persistence matrix

